.TH CUT 1 "2026" "KERNEL32" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cut \- extrait des colonnes / remove sections from lines
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cut
-b|-c|-f list [-d delim] [-s] [file...]
.br
.SH DESCRIPTION
Selects bytes (-b), characters (-c) or delimited fields (-f). Lists are N, N-M, N-, -M separated by commas.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -d delim
Field delimiter (default tab).
.TP
.B -s
Only lines containing the delimiter.
.TP
.B --complement
Select the other fields.
.TP
.B --output-delimiter=S
Output delimiter.
.SH SEE ALSO
paste(1)
